						<tr><td>Board</td><td>Tickets across projects, eight status columns, 1 to 8 running at once</td><td>Kanban issues in the README; the shutdown post lists kanban issues among the removed remote services</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Isolation</td><td>Own git worktree and session per started ticket</td><td>Git worktree and branch per workspace</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Several repos in one task</td><td>No. One project per ticket</td><td>Yes, a workspace can hold several repositories</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Agents</td><td>Ten: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok Build, OpenCode, Pi, omp, fx, Hermes Agent, Antigravity</td><td>10+: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot, Amp, Cursor, OpenCode, Droid, CCR, Qwen Code, and agents from the ACP registry</td></tr>
