						<tr><td>Team or cloud features</td><td>No</td><td>Hosted services removed; a self-hosting guide for Vibe Kanban Cloud</td></tr>
						<tr><td>Remote access</td><td>No access from another device's browser. Agents can run on another Mac, Linux or Windows machine over SSH</td><td>Documented: pair a host and open its workspaces from another device</td></tr>
					</tbody>
